<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #f4f7f4; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2e7d32, #43a047); padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 24px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .body h2 { color: #2e7d32; margin-top: 0; }
    .order-box { background: #f9fbe7; border: 1px solid #c5e1a5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .order-box .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    .order-box .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; font-weight: 700; }
    .total-box { background: #2e7d32; color: #fff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🛒 Order Confirmed!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Hi {{customerName}},</h2>
      <p>Your order has been placed successfully! Here are the details:</p>
      <div class="order-box">
        <div class="row"><span>Order ID</span><span><strong>{{orderId}}</strong></span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Merchant</span><span>{{merchantName}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Items</span><span>{{itemCount}} item(s)</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Delivery</span><span>{{deliveryType}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Payment</span><span>{{paymentMethod}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="total-box">Total: ₹{{totalAmount}}</div>
      <p>We'll keep you updated as your order progresses. You'll receive notifications when your order is confirmed, ready, and delivered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} Green Basket. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
